WEBVTT

00:00:11.380 --> 00:00:17.140
<i>You can't stop real dreams</i>

00:00:17.140 --> 00:00:22.890
<i>Our hearts are about to start running</i>

00:00:22.890 --> 00:00:27.150
"Love Live! Superstar!!"

00:00:39.240 --> 00:00:43.910
<i>Before we knew it,</i>
<i>we found something that we loved</i>

00:00:43.910 --> 00:00:47.420
<i>Let these feelings reach you</i>

00:00:47.420 --> 00:00:50.090
<i>We've made up our minds, we're serious!</i>

00:00:50.090 --> 00:00:52.880
<i>I wonder what we can do</i>

00:00:52.880 --> 00:00:54.800
<i>The sky's so bright</i>

00:00:54.800 --> 00:01:00.220
<i>Let's look up at it</i>
<i>and sing our hearts out</i>

00:01:00.220 --> 00:01:04.310
<i>Doesn't having something you want to do</i>

00:01:04.310 --> 00:01:06.980
<i>Make every day fun?</i>

00:01:06.980 --> 00:01:12.070
<i>Do you feel that way, too?</i>

00:01:12.070 --> 00:01:14.360
<i>Ah, we've been waiting for this moment</i>

00:01:14.360 --> 00:01:17.410
<i>This encounter is where we start</i>

00:01:17.410 --> 00:01:22.790
<i>Our dreams are drawn together,</i>
<i>and it all begins</i>

00:01:22.790 --> 00:01:28.580
<i>We realized our true desires and now,</i>
<i>we can't be stopped</i>

00:01:28.580 --> 00:01:33.960
<i>Our hearts are about to start running</i>

00:01:33.960 --> 00:01:39.800
<i>As fast as they can run</i>

00:01:41.050 --> 00:01:44.770
One, two, three, four...
Keke-<i>chan</i>, stop breathing so hard.

00:01:44.770 --> 00:01:45.480
Okay!

00:01:45.480 --> 00:01:47.770
Sumire-<i>chan</i>, your stopping point
is just a smidge off.

00:01:47.770 --> 00:01:49.400
What?! No way.

00:01:50.770 --> 00:01:54.360
Okay, good work! That's it for today!

00:01:54.360 --> 00:01:55.900
Huh?

00:01:55.900 --> 00:01:57.700
You are way too intense!

00:01:57.700 --> 00:02:00.370
Whoopsies, was I too hardcore?

00:02:00.370 --> 00:02:03.410
I can't move my legs!

00:02:03.410 --> 00:02:05.160
I'm not done yet!

00:02:05.160 --> 00:02:09.170
We're looking good. This is great!

00:02:09.170 --> 00:02:12.920
Let's go for another run
while we're at it!

00:02:12.920 --> 00:02:15.090
You are trying way too hard.

00:02:15.090 --> 00:02:17.630
Well, the Tokyo tournament is soon!

00:02:19.130 --> 00:02:22.850
I was just thinking how fun it is
that we keep getting better

00:02:22.850 --> 00:02:25.100
the harder we try.

00:02:27.810 --> 00:02:28.810
Okay, let's go!

00:02:28.810 --> 00:02:29.890
Seriously?!

00:02:29.890 --> 00:02:31.020
The outer gardens again?

00:02:31.020 --> 00:02:32.520
Let's do about five sets.

00:02:32.520 --> 00:02:33.440
What?!

00:02:33.440 --> 00:02:37.150
--Give us a break!
--Kanon-<i>san </i>has changed quite a bit.

00:02:37.150 --> 00:02:39.280
She seems more positive.

00:02:39.280 --> 00:02:41.740
Nah, that's not it.

00:02:41.740 --> 00:02:43.490
This is the real Kanon-<i>chan</i>.

00:02:44.490 --> 00:02:46.410
The one that I know.

00:02:46.410 --> 00:02:51.920
Sorry to interrupt. Hazuki-<i>san</i>,
the director wants to see you.

00:02:51.920 --> 00:02:53.290
Ren-<i>chan</i>,

00:02:53.290 --> 00:02:55.420
were you looking up naughty things
on the computer again?

00:02:55.420 --> 00:02:57.670
Absolutely not! Please forget
about that incident!

00:02:57.670 --> 00:03:00.590
It's fine. To each their own, I say.

00:03:00.590 --> 00:03:02.970
And I'm saying it's not like that!

00:03:02.970 --> 00:03:05.510
Did we get another offer?

00:03:05.510 --> 00:03:07.020
I'm not sure.

00:03:09.100 --> 00:03:10.270
Look at this.

00:03:13.310 --> 00:03:17.530
Isn't it amazing?
I couldn't believe it either.

00:03:17.530 --> 00:03:19.650
But it's all thanks to you girls.

00:03:19.650 --> 00:03:21.200
But...

00:03:21.200 --> 00:03:25.160
Oh, right. This is from your father.

00:03:25.160 --> 00:03:28.950
He said he'd like to donate the necessary
funds that the school needs.

00:03:28.950 --> 00:03:31.410
Make sure you contact him.

00:03:31.410 --> 00:03:32.960
Father...

00:03:35.750 --> 00:03:37.750
The school got more applicants?

00:03:37.750 --> 00:03:39.840
Yes! With that number,

00:03:39.840 --> 00:03:42.090
we won't have to worry about
having an insufficient amount.

00:03:42.090 --> 00:03:44.840
Yuigaoka will be able to
stay open next year and on.

00:03:44.840 --> 00:03:46.430
That's great!

00:03:46.430 --> 00:03:48.970
I wonder if it's because we did so well
at the regional prelims.

00:03:48.970 --> 00:03:52.480
My rapping must've
reached everyone's hearts.

00:03:52.480 --> 00:03:55.610
Don't get a big head.
It's because of all of us.

00:03:55.610 --> 00:03:58.440
But your rapping was really cool!

00:03:58.440 --> 00:04:01.400
Look at how many followers we have!

00:04:01.490 --> 00:04:02.780
"Following"

00:04:01.490 --> 00:04:02.780
"Followers"

00:04:02.780 --> 00:04:04.990
"Following"
"Followers"

00:04:02.780 --> 00:04:04.990
52,000?!

00:04:04.990 --> 00:04:08.740
Galaxy! Because of the song
where I was the center...

00:04:08.740 --> 00:04:11.160
Because of my song where I was center...

00:04:11.160 --> 00:04:14.460
But it looks like a lot of people
became interested in our school

00:04:14.460 --> 00:04:16.790
because of our performances.

00:04:16.790 --> 00:04:20.300
So the school really is getting
more applicants because of Liella!

00:04:20.300 --> 00:04:24.130
Let's use this momentum
and go straight for the win!

00:04:24.130 --> 00:04:27.430
Did they announce the details
of the Tokyo tournament?

00:04:27.430 --> 00:04:29.350
They'll be announced tonight!

00:04:29.350 --> 00:04:32.600
It's finally time for
the Love Live Tokyo tournament!

00:04:32.600 --> 00:04:34.350
And here's the date!

00:04:34.350 --> 00:04:37.270
Merry Christmas! Ho, ho, ho!

00:04:37.270 --> 00:04:39.520
This time, every group will be performing
remotely from their school

00:04:39.520 --> 00:04:41.360
or associated areas
and will be streaming live!

00:04:41.360 --> 00:04:43.900
We will be presenting that online
in a relay format.

00:04:43.900 --> 00:04:46.450
We'll be battling it out
in Tokyo on Christmas!

00:04:46.450 --> 00:04:48.780
The rules this time are pretty unique.

00:04:48.780 --> 00:04:52.620
We'll have to prepare
our own stage ourselves.

00:04:52.620 --> 00:04:54.410
Where should we perform?

00:04:54.410 --> 00:04:57.630
If we want somewhere extravagant...
The Jingu Stadium?

00:04:57.630 --> 00:04:59.500
That's where the finals will be held.

00:04:59.500 --> 00:05:01.670
Then Gaien Stadium?

00:05:01.670 --> 00:05:04.760
No way. Who would we even ask
to let us use it?

00:05:04.760 --> 00:05:06.840
I'll go there in person tomorrow and ask!

00:05:06.840 --> 00:05:08.470
Let's not cause any trouble.

00:05:08.470 --> 00:05:12.140
It's the Tokyo tournament!
Why are you so laid back?!

00:05:12.140 --> 00:05:15.020
I'm seriously thinking about this.

00:05:15.020 --> 00:05:16.770
This is the Tokyo tournament!

00:05:16.770 --> 00:05:19.900
I'm sure that each area will be
performing from somewhere special!

00:05:19.900 --> 00:05:23.690
We'll be overshadowed easily
with a mediocre stage!

00:05:25.950 --> 00:05:27.450
Congratulations!

00:05:27.450 --> 00:05:28.490
What the?!

00:05:28.490 --> 00:05:30.780
You got through the regional prelims?

00:05:30.780 --> 00:05:33.660
Jeez! You don't tell us anything!

00:05:33.660 --> 00:05:36.670
I didn't think you'd be interested at all.

00:05:36.670 --> 00:05:40.000
People at my middle school
have been talking about you, too.

00:05:40.000 --> 00:05:42.170
You sang by yourself
the other day, didn't you?

00:05:42.170 --> 00:05:43.710
That's wonderful!

00:05:43.710 --> 00:05:45.170
Thanks.

00:05:46.630 --> 00:05:48.590
A remote concert?

00:05:48.590 --> 00:05:50.800
Where are you making your stage?

00:05:50.800 --> 00:05:52.510
The Gaien Stadium?!

00:05:52.510 --> 00:05:55.350
That would be absolutely
amazing if we could,

00:05:55.350 --> 00:05:59.690
but realistically, we're thinking
about our gymnasium...

00:06:00.560 --> 00:06:02.400
This is the Tokyo tournament, right?

00:06:02.400 --> 00:06:03.360
Yeah...

00:06:03.360 --> 00:06:05.940
This can make or break
your chance at the finals, right?

00:06:05.940 --> 00:06:06.780
Yeah...

00:06:06.780 --> 00:06:08.410
And you're choosing our gym?!

00:06:08.410 --> 00:06:09.610
You need to want more!

00:06:09.610 --> 00:06:11.660
Do you have any intention of winning?

00:06:12.870 --> 00:06:14.660
What should we do?

00:06:14.660 --> 00:06:17.580
That's why I said that idea's too plain.

00:06:17.580 --> 00:06:19.540
But everyone will be on winter break,

00:06:19.540 --> 00:06:22.090
so I thought it'd be rough
if we performed outside.

00:06:22.090 --> 00:06:24.460
You're worrying too much.

00:06:24.460 --> 00:06:27.170
Liella! basically represents
our school now.

00:06:27.170 --> 00:06:29.680
I think we can be a little selfish.

00:06:29.680 --> 00:06:32.260
I really envy you
and that personality of yours.

00:06:32.260 --> 00:06:33.970
What's that supposed to mean?!

00:06:34.850 --> 00:06:38.230
Honestly, I'm just happy to be singing...

00:06:40.350 --> 00:06:42.560
They said no...

00:06:42.560 --> 00:06:43.400
Flop.

00:06:43.400 --> 00:06:44.520
Keke-<i>chan</i>?!

00:06:44.520 --> 00:06:46.030
Where did you go?

00:06:46.030 --> 00:06:49.570
I went to every possible
live venue I could think of,

00:06:49.570 --> 00:06:54.580
but they all said that they
weren't suited for school idols.

00:06:54.580 --> 00:06:59.290
Well, this whole area wasn't
exactly known for school idols...

00:06:59.290 --> 00:07:01.500
We really need to decide soon though.

00:07:01.500 --> 00:07:05.250
Yeah, I'll head home
and think it over tonight.

00:07:06.500 --> 00:07:07.510
I'm home.

00:07:07.510 --> 00:07:09.630
Welcome home.

00:07:09.630 --> 00:07:11.470
Mao-<i>san</i>! Yuuna-<i>san</i>!

00:07:11.470 --> 00:07:12.510
Pa!

00:07:12.510 --> 00:07:14.010
It's been a while.

00:07:14.010 --> 00:07:16.810
We're in town to buy stuff
for the Tokyo tournament.

00:07:16.810 --> 00:07:19.180
So we came by to say hi!

00:07:19.180 --> 00:07:20.350
It looks like

00:07:20.350 --> 00:07:23.810
you've been practicing really hard
since the tournament's coming up soon.

00:07:23.810 --> 00:07:26.730
Yes! And we got more applicants
for our school, too.

00:07:26.730 --> 00:07:28.490
I'm having so much fun right now!

00:07:28.490 --> 00:07:30.950
Pa! And that's most important!

00:07:30.950 --> 00:07:34.410
Let's all do our best to
put on our best performances.

00:07:34.410 --> 00:07:35.660
Right!

00:07:35.660 --> 00:07:37.200
But...

00:07:37.200 --> 00:07:39.080
We're the ones who are gonna win.

00:07:39.080 --> 00:07:41.920
We have no intention of losing to you.

00:07:42.920 --> 00:07:45.880
W-We're not going to lose either.

00:07:47.300 --> 00:07:50.470
I'm sorry! I didn't mean
to sound so arrogant.

00:07:52.630 --> 00:07:54.760
Um...

00:07:54.760 --> 00:07:55.970
Meaning?

00:07:55.970 --> 00:08:01.640
Yes. Everyone keeps talking about winning
or how we can go to the nationals then...

00:08:01.640 --> 00:08:05.730
But I don't know how to feel about winning
or losing when it comes to singing.

00:08:05.730 --> 00:08:08.610
So you're saying
you'd be fine if you lost to us?

00:08:08.610 --> 00:08:12.200
No! I definitely want to
perform the best song!

00:08:12.200 --> 00:08:16.070
I want to practice hard with everyone
and put on our best performance!

00:08:17.280 --> 00:08:21.620
But I'd been so nervous
I wouldn't be able to sing for so long,

00:08:21.620 --> 00:08:27.750
so just the fact that I can express myself
freely makes me so happy.

00:08:27.750 --> 00:08:29.050
I see.

00:08:29.050 --> 00:08:33.680
I get what you're saying. Singing might
not exactly be about competing.

00:08:33.680 --> 00:08:35.930
You can even enjoy it alone.

00:08:35.930 --> 00:08:37.100
Right?

00:08:37.100 --> 00:08:38.890
Even then...

00:08:38.890 --> 00:08:42.430
We can become even better
by butting heads.

00:08:42.430 --> 00:08:45.230
Because of the Love Live,

00:08:45.230 --> 00:08:49.360
the level of performances from
school idols just keeps going up.

00:08:49.360 --> 00:08:51.480
I see...

00:08:51.480 --> 00:08:52.860
You don't like that?

00:08:52.860 --> 00:08:55.570
No! I'm just not mentally there yet.

00:08:55.570 --> 00:09:00.120
It's all right. Once you sing
at the Love Live, you'll realize it.

00:09:00.120 --> 00:09:05.420
Why everyone wants to win...
Or rather, why we have to win.

00:09:14.220 --> 00:09:16.470
--Why everyone wants to win...
--Five, four, three, two, one...

00:09:16.470 --> 00:09:20.310
--Five, four, three, two, one...

00:09:37.450 --> 00:09:40.200
Why don't we go with stars
for our theme this time?

00:09:40.200 --> 00:09:41.160
Stars?

00:09:41.160 --> 00:09:44.700
Yeah, that's what I thought up
after seeing the city all lit up.

00:09:44.700 --> 00:09:49.250
I thought we could turn
our gym into a starry sky.

00:09:49.250 --> 00:09:50.960
That'd be absolutely beautiful!

00:09:50.960 --> 00:09:53.170
The Yuigaoka stars.

00:09:53.170 --> 00:09:54.260
That's a great idea!

00:09:54.260 --> 00:09:58.590
But if that's the case,
we need to get to work immediately.

00:09:58.590 --> 00:10:00.720
Hold up.

00:10:00.720 --> 00:10:05.430
Leave the stage to us.
You girls concentrate on practicing.

00:10:05.430 --> 00:10:06.350
But...

00:10:06.350 --> 00:10:09.350
If you're not able to sing your best
because you were busy preparing for this,

00:10:09.350 --> 00:10:11.060
we're the ones who'll regret it.

00:10:11.060 --> 00:10:15.490
We're all first years, so even if we
enter competitions for other clubs,

00:10:15.490 --> 00:10:17.280
we don't really stand a chance.

00:10:17.280 --> 00:10:20.530
And yet, you girls have gotten this far.

00:10:20.530 --> 00:10:23.870
You girls are the hope of our school.

00:10:23.870 --> 00:10:26.710
So let us cheer you on.

00:10:26.710 --> 00:10:27.710
Everyone...

00:10:27.710 --> 00:10:30.880
That's so lovely! You're all so lovely!

00:10:30.880 --> 00:10:33.170
What are you crying for?

00:10:33.170 --> 00:10:35.090
Look who's talking!

00:10:35.090 --> 00:10:37.260
Okay, why don't we practice then?

00:10:37.260 --> 00:10:38.300
Yeah.

00:10:40.260 --> 00:10:42.510
Have fun!

00:10:43.560 --> 00:10:45.020
It's so cold!

00:10:45.020 --> 00:10:48.980
This is nothing compared to Shanghai.

00:10:48.980 --> 00:10:49.980
Chi-<i>chan</i>...

00:10:49.980 --> 00:10:51.350
Hm?

00:10:51.350 --> 00:10:54.230
I'm glad I went to this school.

00:10:55.780 --> 00:11:00.740
I never thought every day would be filled
with so much excitement and wonder.

00:11:00.740 --> 00:11:02.120
Me neither!

00:11:02.120 --> 00:11:03.870
Agreed.

00:11:06.410 --> 00:11:10.000
"Headed towards the Tokyo tournament!!"

00:11:11.460 --> 00:11:14.000
<i>Love Live! Superstar!!</i>

00:11:24.680 --> 00:11:29.430
It's 6:20. We're performing tonight.

00:11:29.430 --> 00:11:31.980
I've got plenty of time to sleep...

00:11:32.980 --> 00:11:37.070
No! I need to wake up! It's so cold!

00:11:39.900 --> 00:11:41.530
The first snowfall!

00:11:42.740 --> 00:11:45.910
Why did it have to happen
today of all days?

00:11:45.910 --> 00:11:48.040
No slacking, Sis!

00:11:48.040 --> 00:11:48.910
I know.

00:11:48.910 --> 00:11:51.370
Sumire!

00:11:51.370 --> 00:11:54.710
What are you doing here this early?
We're performing tonight.

00:11:57.170 --> 00:12:00.550
I had nowhere else to go, so I came here.

00:12:00.550 --> 00:12:03.090
Please hold onto this just for a day.

00:12:03.090 --> 00:12:05.220
Isn't that your treasure?

00:12:05.220 --> 00:12:08.060
But just for today, we're rivals.

00:12:08.060 --> 00:12:11.230
Just for today, I'm going to
stop being their fan.

00:12:11.230 --> 00:12:12.350
Here.

00:12:13.730 --> 00:12:18.940
I'm just going to give this to you.
So that we can continue as a group.

00:12:27.580 --> 00:12:28.990
All set.

00:12:33.160 --> 00:12:36.040
It's a big circle.

00:12:38.630 --> 00:12:40.210
Here you are.

00:12:40.210 --> 00:12:43.760
Saya-<i>san</i>, I'm so happy
I get to live with you again.

00:12:43.760 --> 00:12:45.090
Likewise.

00:12:45.090 --> 00:12:48.600
You've been working so hard to protect
the school your mother established.

00:12:48.600 --> 00:12:52.430
I'm honored to be able to serve you again.

00:12:54.770 --> 00:12:55.690
Morning!

00:12:55.690 --> 00:12:57.150
Wow, you're up early.

00:12:57.150 --> 00:12:59.900
Can I take breakfast with me to school?

00:12:59.900 --> 00:13:01.030
Of course.

00:13:01.030 --> 00:13:02.860
Sis!

00:13:02.860 --> 00:13:05.450
You forgot your headphones.

00:13:06.360 --> 00:13:08.120
I don't need them anymore!

00:13:11.410 --> 00:13:13.540
I wonder how the stage is coming along.

00:13:13.540 --> 00:13:14.540
I'm not sure.

00:13:14.540 --> 00:13:15.710
I can't wait to see it!

00:13:15.710 --> 00:13:18.080
No one knows what's going on?

00:13:18.080 --> 00:13:20.750
They wanted to surprise us,
so they asked us to wait until tonight.

00:13:20.750 --> 00:13:22.800
They said they'd come get us
when it's done.

00:13:22.800 --> 00:13:24.590
Maybe we should help them out.

00:13:24.590 --> 00:13:25.550
Agreed.

00:13:25.550 --> 00:13:28.600
Well, considering this snow,
let's think of our health first,

00:13:28.600 --> 00:13:30.720
and wrap practice up early.

00:13:30.720 --> 00:13:33.270
Then let's just go through
our choreography once

00:13:33.270 --> 00:13:34.640
and then go help them out.

00:13:34.640 --> 00:13:36.100
That's a good idea.

00:13:44.490 --> 00:13:46.280
Huh?

00:13:46.280 --> 00:13:47.820
Wait...

00:13:47.820 --> 00:13:50.450
What?!

00:13:50.450 --> 00:13:53.750
There's no stage!

00:13:53.750 --> 00:13:56.670
This is awful. This is the worst.
How could this happen?

00:13:56.670 --> 00:13:58.040
Kanon-<i>chan</i>!

00:13:59.830 --> 00:14:01.380
This is just too cruel.

00:14:01.380 --> 00:14:04.920
No! We've almost got
the perfect stage done.

00:14:04.920 --> 00:14:07.430
At a place much better than this.

00:14:28.360 --> 00:14:29.860
This is...

00:14:29.860 --> 00:14:32.080
If you keep going down this path...

00:14:32.080 --> 00:14:34.450
Your stage is up ahead.

00:14:34.450 --> 00:14:38.460
The best stage that everyone
at Yuigaoka could've prepared.

00:14:44.460 --> 00:14:46.210
You've got this, Liella!

00:14:46.210 --> 00:14:47.720
Ren-<i>chan</i>!

00:14:47.720 --> 00:14:49.260
Chisato-<i>chan</i>!

00:14:49.260 --> 00:14:50.640
Sumire-<i>chan</i>!

00:14:50.640 --> 00:14:52.260
Keke-<i>chan</i>!

00:14:52.260 --> 00:14:54.510
Kanon-<i>chan</i>!

00:14:54.510 --> 00:14:57.020
You've got this!

00:15:00.060 --> 00:15:01.310
Go!

00:15:01.310 --> 00:15:03.060
Fight!

00:15:04.270 --> 00:15:05.570
No need to hurry!

00:15:05.570 --> 00:15:07.530
Watch your step!

00:15:14.450 --> 00:15:15.790
She's so scary!

00:15:15.790 --> 00:15:17.660
Please wait!

00:15:19.040 --> 00:15:21.040
It's almost time!

00:15:22.130 --> 00:15:23.000
It's shining.

00:15:23.000 --> 00:15:24.750
I can almost see it!

00:15:41.560 --> 00:15:43.100
Wow...

00:15:43.100 --> 00:15:46.440
Everyone at school
decided to ask the town...

00:15:46.440 --> 00:15:50.570
And they said we could use this area
freely for the time being.

00:15:50.570 --> 00:15:52.160
We can sing here?

00:15:52.160 --> 00:15:55.580
Yup. People around town helped out, too.

00:15:55.580 --> 00:15:59.750
This is a stage that
only we could've created.

00:15:59.750 --> 00:16:04.750
Now, show us. Show us the best
performance Liella! can put on.

00:16:07.210 --> 00:16:08.420
Right!

00:16:16.180 --> 00:16:18.060
It's nice to meet you, everyone!

00:16:18.060 --> 00:16:22.190
We're the school idols from
Yuigaoka Girls' High School.

00:16:22.190 --> 00:16:23.850
We're Liella!

00:16:26.020 --> 00:16:29.230
Standing on this stage right now
and seeing this scenery,

00:16:29.230 --> 00:16:31.570
I can say this proudly...

00:16:31.570 --> 00:16:35.070
I'm so glad to be a student at Yuigaoka.

00:16:35.070 --> 00:16:37.830
That our school is the best!

00:16:39.040 --> 00:16:43.080
Please listen to our song!

00:16:49.670 --> 00:16:55.340
♬ I feel a tiny flickering
deep inside my heart again ♬

00:16:55.340 --> 00:17:01.140
♬ My aspirations run wild,
