00:17:29.500 --> 00:17:35.340
♬ Our story is just beginning ♬

00:17:35.340 --> 00:17:39.850
♬ It can create any kind of miracle ♬

00:17:39.850 --> 00:17:45.730
♬ Sparkly dreams scatter
