Kanon-<i>chan</i>.

00:20:03.370 --> 00:20:05.950
We didn't make it. I'm sorry.

00:20:05.950 --> 00:20:09.950
No... Thank you. That was
the best performance ever.

00:20:09.950 --> 00:20:13.540
I was so proud and moved!

00:20:13.540 --> 00:20:16.880
Sorry we couldn't help you win.

00:20:17.960 --> 00:20:20.510
Hey, we have to get this cleaned up.

00:20:20.510 --> 00:20:21.760
Right...

00:20:21.760 --> 00:20:24.300
