00:20:45.490 --> 00:20:50.580
Everyone did so much to help us out,
and we couldn't do anything in return.

00:20:51.500 --> 00:20:53.790
Everyone did so much to help us out...

00:20:54.710 --> 00:20:57.460
...and it's all over without
being able to repay them!

00:20:58.550 --> 00:21:00.010
Kanon...

00:21:00.010 --> 00:21:02.010
