"We did it!" with everyone!

00:21:17.860 --> 00:21:21.280
With our song. With Liella!'s song...

00:21:21.280 --> 00:21:24.240
With Yuigaoka's song...
That's how I want to win.

00:21:24.240 --> 00:21:25.490
No...

00:21:28.780 --> 00:21:31.410
We're going to win!

00:21:31.410 --> 00:21:33.410
Of course, we are.

00:21:33.410 --> 00:21:36.290
Liella!'s not going to stop here.

00:21:36.290 --> 00:21:39.040
I knew that from the start.

00:21:39.040 --> 00:21:41.880
Yuigaoka is the best school!

00:21:45.220 --> 00:21:49.680
Yuigaoka Girls' High School's
school idols, Liella!

00:21:49.680 --> 00:21:53.810
We're going to make sure
even more people hear our songs!

00:21:54.890 --> 00:21:57.690
Song for me! Song for you!

00:21:57.690 --> 00:22:01.070
Song for all!

00:22:04.360 --> 00:22:06.150
